<title>ECUADOR: SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT URUGUAY 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT URUGUAY 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador beat Uruguay 4-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a South American World Cup qualifying match on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Alex Aguinaga 6, Agustin Delgado 69, 77, Kleber</p>
<p>Chala 88</p>
</text>
